{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">DICTIONARY statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309328","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DICTIONARY-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/DICTIONARY-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"DICTIONARY-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">DICTIONARY statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Runs the OpenEdge Data Dictionary.</p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does not apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DICTIONARY-statement__syntax_GC16HJ2689362\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d391433e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"DICTIONARY-statement__idGDJ2AH2668294\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DICTIONARY</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DICTIONARY-statement__example_GC16HK2689366\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d391433e125\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure runs the Data Dictionary if the user answers yes to a prompt:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-dict.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"DICTIONARY-statement__idGDJ2AI2668298\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE ans AS LOGICAL NO-UNDO.\n\nDISPLAY &quot;Do you want to access the Dictionary?&quot;\n  WITH ROW 7 COLUMN 20 NO-LABELS.\nUPDATE ans.\nIF ans THEN <strong class=\"ph b\">DICTIONARY.</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"DICTIONARY-statement__notes_GC16HL2689371\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d391433e162\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">The\nDICTIONARY statement is equivalent to RUN <span class=\"ph filepath\">dict.p</span>:\nit runs the ABL procedure called <span class=\"ph filepath\">dict.p</span>. The\nAVM uses the regular search rules to find the dictionary procedure.\nThe dictionary procedure is part of the ABL system software.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The AVM Query/Run-time provides a restricted version of the\nData Dictionary.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For more information on the Data Dictionary, see its on-line help.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DESTRUCTOR-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DESTRUCTOR-statement.html\">DESTRUCTOR statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DISABLE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DISABLE-statement.html\">DISABLE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309328","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"DICTIONARY statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DICTIONARY-statement.html","type":"Manual"}